	\qitem{c}{``[...] The ADAS-cog scores worsened in all three groups (mean change, 6.4 points in the placebo group, 7.5 points in the group receiving 100 mg of the study drug, and 7.8 points in the group receiving 140 mg; P=0.15 and P=0.07, respectively, for the comparison with placebo). The ADCSADL scores also worsened in all groups [...] P=0.14 and P<0.001, respectively, for the comparison with placebo).``}
